2448	/* Hard guard: an access [rel_off, rel_off+len) must stay fully inside this
2449	 * MTD window. /dev/sd0 is FS_REGION only; /dev/sdkv is KV_REGION only. Use
2450	 * 64-bit math so the end can't wrap onto boot images.
